e">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 681, "quote": "HYMN LXXXIV. Manyu."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-85"><data key="title">RV 10.85 · Surya’s wedding</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">The wedding of Surya frames marriage verses, the journey of the bride, and blessings for a shared household.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">682</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 682, "quote": "HYMN LXXXV. Surya's Bridal."}, {"doc": "rigveda", "page": 682, "quote": "1. TRUTH is the base that bears the earth; by Surya are the heavens"}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-86"><data key="title">RV 10.86 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">684</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 684, "quote": "HYMN LXXXVI. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-87"><data key="title">RV 10.87 · Agni</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Agni. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">686</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 686, "quote": "HYMN LXXXVII. Agni."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-88"><data key="title">RV 10.88 · Agni</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Agni. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">688</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 688, "quote": "HYMN LXXXVIII. Agni."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-89"><data key="title">RV 10.89 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">689</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 689, "quote": "HYMN LXXXIX. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-90"><data key="title">RV 10.90 · Purusha hymn</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">The cosmic Person is described through a primordial sacrifice whose divisions are related to the cosmos and social orders.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">691</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 691, "quote": "HYMN XC. Purusa."}, {"doc": "rigveda", "page": 691, "quote": "1. A THOUSAND heads hath Purusa, a thousand eyes, a thousand feet."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-91"><data key="title">RV 10.91 · Agni</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Agni. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">691</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 691, "quote": "HYMN XCI. Agni."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-92"><data key="title">RV 10.92 · Visvedevas</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Visvedevas. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">693</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 693, "quote": "HYMN XCII. Visvedevas."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-93"><data key="title">RV 10.93 · Visvedevas</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Visvedevas. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">694</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 694, "quote": "HYMN XCIII. Visvedevas."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-94"><data key="title">RV 10.94 · Press-stones</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Press-stones. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">695</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 695, "quote": "HYMN XCIV. Press-stones."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-95"><data key="title">RV 10.95 · Pururavas and Urvashi</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Dialogue of the separated Pururavas and Urvashi, with recollection, appeal, and separation.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">696</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 696, "quote": "HYMN XCV. Urvasi. Pururavas."}, {"doc": "rigveda", "page": 696, "quote": "1. Ho there, my consort! Stay, thou fierce-souled lady, and let us reason for"}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-96"><data key="title">RV 10.96 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">698</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 698, "quote": "HYMN XCVI. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-97"><data key="title">RV 10.97 · Praise of Herbs</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Praise of Herbs. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">699</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 699, "quote": "HYMN XCVII. Praise of Herbs."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-98"><data key="title">RV 10.98 · The Gods</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: The Gods. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">700</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 700, "quote": "HYMN XCVIII. The Gods."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-99"><data key="title">RV 10.99 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">701</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 701, "quote": "HYMN XCIX. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-100"><data key="title">RV 10.100 · Visvedevas</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Visvedevas. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">702</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 702, "quote": "HYMN C. Visvedevas."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-101"><data key="title">RV 10.101 · Visvedevas</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Visvedevas. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">703</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 703, "quote": "HYMN CI. Visvedevas."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-102"><data key="title">RV 10.102 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">704</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 704, "quote": "HYMN CII. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-103"><data key="title">RV 10.103 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">705</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 705, "quote": "HYMN CIII. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-104"><data key="title">RV 10.104 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">706</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 706, "quote": "HYMN CIV. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-105"><data key="title">RV 10.105 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">707</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 707, "quote": "HYMN CV. Indra."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-106"><data key="title">RV 10.106 · Asvins</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Asvins. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">707</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 707, "quote": "HYMN CVI. Asvins."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-107"><data key="title">RV 10.107 · Daksina</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Daksina. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">708</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 708, "quote": "HYMN CVII. Daksina."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-108"><data key="title">RV 10.108 · Sarama and the Panis</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Sarama, sent by Indra, confronts the Panis over hidden cattle; the exchange turns on kinship, wealth, and the cattle’s recovery.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">709</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 709, "quote": "HYMN CVIII. Sarama. Panis."}, {"doc": "rigveda", "page": 709, "quote": "1. WHAT wish of Sarama hath brought her hither? The path leads far away to"}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-109"><data key="title">RV 10.109 · Visvedevas</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Visvedevas. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">710</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 710, "quote": "HYMN CIX. Visvedevas."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-110"><data key="title">RV 10.110 · Apris</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Apris. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">711</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "rigveda", "page": 711, "quote": "HYMN CX. Apris."}]</data></node><node id="rv-10-111"><data key="title">RV 10.111 · Indra</data><data key="type">hymn</data><data key="summary">Hymn heading: Indra. Read the cited passage for the complete hymn.</data><data key="doc">rigveda</data><data key="page">711</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc