ord of Devas, was seated in the middle of the assembly surrounded by the guardians of the worlds, Devas and Sages. He was encircled by bevies of celestia"}]</data></node><node id="p-skanda-ch-10"><data key="title">Shiva Swallows the Poison</data><data key="type">story</data><data key="summary">Chapter 10 of the supplied Kedarakhanda: Shiva Swallows the Poison. The contents list supplies the title and printed-page location.</data><data key="doc">the-skanda-purana</data><data key="page">78</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "the-skanda-purana", "page": 78, "quote": "CHAPTER TEN Siva Swallows the Poison The sages said: I. 0 holy Sir, you said that the Cosmic Egg including the mobile ard immobile beings was entirely reduced to ash by the fire of Kalakiita on account of the wrath of Rudra. :!-4. But. we c"}]</data></node><node id="p-skanda-ch-11"><data key="title">Ganesha Worship and Manifestation of Lakshmi</data><data key="type">story</data><data key="summary">Chapter 11 of the supplied Kedarakhanda: Ganesha Worship and Manifestation of Lakshmi. The contents list supplies the title and printed-page location.</data><data key="doc">the-skanda-purana</data><data key="page">86</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "the-skanda-purana", "page": 86, "quote": "CHAPTER ELEVEN 1 Procedure of Gal)esa Worship: Manifestation of Lak1ml Mahesvara said: I. In every fortnight Gal)esa should be worshipped on the fourth day. (But) in the bright half of the month a devotee, after taking bath, should worship"}]</data></node><node id="p-skanda-ch-12"><data key="title">Devas Taste the Divine Nectar</data><data key="type">story</data><data key="summary">Chapter 12 of the supplied Kedarakhanda: Devas Taste the Divine Nectar. The contents list supplies the title and printed-page location.</data><data key="doc">the-skanda-purana</data><data key="page">94</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "the-skanda-purana", "page": 94, "quote": "CHAPTER 1WELVE Devas Taste the Divine Nectar 1 Lomasa said: 1. Af