n his part to have enemity tow"}]</data></edge><edge id="e6388" source="p-shiv-maha-purana-1-5-2-32" target="concept-vishnu"><data key="type">theme</data><data key="summary">Editorial theme tag on this indexed entry; compare the source in context.</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "shiv-maha-purana-1", "page": 20, "quote": "5.2.32 Dailogue Between Brahma &amp; Vishnu Lord Brahma then remembered Vishnuji, who appeared instantaneously. Brahmaji revealed about his intentions to him. LordVishnu told him that it was foolishness on his part to have enemity tow"}]</data></edge><edge id="e6389" source="p-shiv-maha-purana-1-5-2-33" target="concept-shiva"><data key="type">theme</data><data key="summary">Editorial theme tag on this indexed entry; compare the source in context.</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "shiv-maha-purana-1", "page": 20, "quote": "5.2.33 Goddess Durga After lord Vishnu went away, Lord Brahma started meditating on the form of goddess Durga. She appeared before him. Lord Brahma said-"}]</data></edge><edge id="e6390" source="p-shiv-maha-purana-1-5-2-33" target="concept-vishnu"><data key="type">theme</data><data key="summary">Editorial theme tag on this indexed entry; compare the source in context.</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "shiv-maha-purana-1", "page": 20, "quote": "5.2.33 Goddess Durga After lord Vishnu went away, Lord Brahma started meditating on the form of goddess Durga. She appeared before him. Lord Brahma said-"}]</data></edge><edge id="e6391" source="p-shiv-maha-purana-1-5-2-33" target="concept-devi"><data key="type">theme</data><data key="summary">Editorial theme tag on this indexed entry; compare the source in context.</data><data key="evidence">[{"doc": "shiv-maha-purana-1", "page": 20, "quote": "5.2.33 Goddess Durga After lord Vishnu went away, Lord Brahma started meditating on the form of goddess Durga. She appeared before him. Lord Brahma said-"}]</data></edge><edge id="e6392" source="p-shiv-maha-purana-1-5-2-33" target="concept-y